<event start="TLI_243" end="TLI_244">(1.95) </event>
<event start="TLI_244" end="TLI_245">in Russland an der Düna un  </event>
<event start="TLI_245" end="TLI_246">(1.17) </event>
<event start="TLI_246" end="TLI_247">wie hieß denn de? </event>
