<event start="TLI_264" end="TLI_265">achtzehn, </event>
<event start="TLI_265" end="TLI_266">net? </event>
<event start="TLI_266" end="TLI_267">(0.4) </event>
<event start="TLI_267" end="TLI_268">war de Kriech zu Ende, ne? </event>
